Version 4.1
SHEET 1 880 680
WIRE 192 128 176 128
WIRE 192 144 176 144
WIRE 192 160 176 160
FLAG 192 128 b
FLAG 192 144 h
FLAG 192 160 mue
TEXT -32 96 Left 2 !vpwl2 b 0 pwl 0s 0 1.6s {3*BN} ; pwl for B
TEXT -32 120 Left 2 !.tran 1600ms
TEXT -32 8 Left 2 !.param m=7 a=0.75 b={1-a} Hn=200*1.414 Bn=1.2*1.414 ;  HN,BN=EisenNickellegierung NiFe (low induction not mumetall)
TEXT -32 24 Left 2 !Eh h 0 value={Hn*(a*v(b)/Bn+b*(v(b)/Bn)^m)} tripdv=1 tripdt=1
TEXT -32 56 Left 2 !Eh2 h2 0 value={table(v(b),0,0,0.8,100,1.6,250,2.0,480,2.4,1100,2.8,3000,3.2,6400,3.75,20000,4.5,65000,5.1,155000)} tripdv=1 tripdt=1
TEXT -32 136 Left 2 ;Plot v(vpwl2) vs v(h2) for table source\nPlot v(vpwl2) vs v(h) for formula source
TEXT 176 96 Left 2 !emue mue 0 value={v(b)/v(h)/4/pi*1e7} tripdv=1 tripdt=1
TEXT -32 -8 Left 2 ;NOTE: Magnetizing shape exact only at point HN,BN
